### KisaanSaarthi API Examples
### Use with REST Client extension in VS Code

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@token = your_jwt_token_here

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ============================================
### AUTHENTICATION
### ============================================

### Request OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/request-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+919876543210"
}

### Verify OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+919876543210",
  "otp": "123456"
}

### Get Profile (Authenticated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update Profile (Authenticated)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rajesh Kumar",
  "metadata": {
    "location": "Ludhiana",
    "crops": ["Wheat", "Rice"]
  }
}

### ============================================
### MANDI PRICES
### ============================================

### Get All Mandi Prices
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mandi

### Get Mandi Prices - Filter by State
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mandi?state=Punjab

### Get Mandi Prices - Filter by Crop
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mandi?crop=Wheat

### Get Mandi Prices - Multiple Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mandi?state=Punjab&crop=Wheat&limit=10

### Get Mandi Price History
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mandi/history?state=Punjab&crop=Wheat&days=30

### Get States List
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mandi/states

### Get Crops List
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mandi/crops

### Get Crops by State
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mandi/crops?state=Punjab

### Get Mandis List
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mandi/mandis

### Get Mandis by State
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mandi/mandis?state=Punjab

### ============================================
### WEATHER
### ============================================

### Get Weather - Ludhiana
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/weather?lat=30.9010&lon=75.8573&location=Ludhiana

### Get Weather - Delhi
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/weather?lat=28.6139&lon=77.2090&location=Delhi

### ============================================
### GOVERNMENT SCHEMES
### ============================================

### Get All Schemes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/schemes

### Get Schemes - Filter by State
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/schemes?state=Punjab

### Get Schemes - Filter by Category
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/schemes?category=subsidy

### Get Schemes - Verified Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/schemes?verified=true

### Get Scheme by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/schemes/scheme-id-here

### ============================================
### SUBSCRIPTIONS (Requires Auth)
### ============================================

### Create Subscription - Mandi Price Alert
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "mandi_price",
  "filter": {
    "state": "Punjab",
    "crop": "Wheat"
  },
  "mode": "whatsapp"
}

### Create Subscription - Weather Alert
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "weather",
  "filter": {
    "location": "Ludhiana",
    "lat": 30.9010,
    "lon": 75.8573
  },
  "mode": "sms"
}

### Get My Subscriptions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update Subscription
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/subscriptions/subscription-id-here
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "active": false
}

### Delete Subscription
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/subscriptions/subscription-id-here
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### ORDERS & PAYMENTS (Requires Auth)
### ============================================

### Create Order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 100,
  "metadata": {
    "service": "form_filling",
    "description": "PM-KISAN registration help"
  }
}

### Verify Payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "razorpay_order_id": "order_xxx",
  "razorpay_payment_id": "pay_xxx",
  "razorpay_signature": "signature_xxx"
}

### Get My Orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Orders - Filter by Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders?status=paid
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Order by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/order-id-here
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### HELP REQUESTS (Requires Auth)
### ============================================

### Create Help Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/help
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "form_filling",
  "description": "Need help with PM-KISAN registration. I have all documents ready.",
  "attachments": []
}

### Create Help Request - Document Help
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/help
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "document_help",
  "description": "Need help understanding land records for subsidy application",
  "attachments": ["https://example.com/document1.pdf"]
}

### Get My Help Requests
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/help
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Help Requests - Filter by Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/help?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Help Request by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/help/help-request-id-here
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update Help Request Status (Admin Only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/help/help-request-id-here/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "in_progress",
  "assigned_to": "admin-user-id"
}
